[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4560.31, "timestamp": "01:16:00", "text": "え、何？ あなたは村にいます。 どこにいるの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4562.709, "timestamp": "01:16:02", "text": "？ えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4566.149, "timestamp": "01:16:06", "text": "えーと、待って、地図に私が見えてないの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4568.63, "timestamp": "01:16:08", "text": "ああ、そうだね。 ええ、分かります。 はい、私の間違いでした。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4570.95, "timestamp": "01:16:10", "text": "うん、うん、そこだよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4572.229, "timestamp": "01:16:12", "text": "うん。   開始の合図をしてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4593.51, "timestamp": "01:16:33", "text": "なぜ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4597.59, "timestamp": "01:16:37", "text": "何？ 何かが何かであり、あなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4601.91, "timestamp": "01:16:41", "text": "起こしたいような良い人たちではない[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4604.39, "timestamp": "01:16:44", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4606.79, "timestamp": "01:16:46", "text": "うん、それはまずいね。 彼らは今すぐ睡眠が必要だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4609.91, "timestamp": "01:16:49", "text": "彼らは一生懸命働いてきた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4611.11, "timestamp": "01:16:51", "text": "ええ、申し訳なく思います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4618.149, "timestamp": "01:16:58", "text": "。 私は"}]